{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1575,
  "batch_count": 1697,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "89bbda6948bf092a08e3287e29276a39db038159",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:910444ebb45167b63d5daa1f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "梦旅帮我占好了赏花的位置……\n也有你的座位。你会给她个面子，\n过去坐坐吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "de2e97cbd6c13d631f3b55c791dfd2ff3fd7cfbb61e9fa337d0b7034bd8f1b40",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69df49389bce3f513830b2ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想再去乘凉呢……去那个湖边。\n从第一次去的时候起，\n不知为何就觉得是个让人怀念的地方……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3ecb3c1e70abe9dfb150de663ae2a034bcfd2d9dc90dfa2421578a7b2bc1776",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c965fbb156299a9656acf45f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个时节红叶应该很漂亮吧。\n下周一起……啊，现在出发也\n可以吧？……啊，我可是认真的哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4aa7ba2cd6c3cff845161e8e0866e935ac9cab07902220a6c31dda9d4bc8fbae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9c654e423093d71c6a64356",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看到外面那个巨大的黄金船雪雕了吗？\n建议往眼睛里的松果塞进灯泡的人，\n就是我。……呵呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2797c5789bea09f968098d487d8ddd5a48c5c2b7d66c6e1aaf30b664575171ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c437b7be84cc99d657aa6b4e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "祝你情人节快乐，就这样吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "486f48a3fb0a34f1c0a014244fb161fec55e02bfecc012db24d854acf3db0322",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e01a6cc414f243bfb80a2008",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "旅行之前，偶尔会和中山庆典打赌。\n赌我会不会忘记带伴手礼。\n……那家伙，其实很想要吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "463edd73a6fa9c04885a91f11421ec96a444f33b04004d34abd4465be1c972c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35dad4545d24150fed22bbb9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "梦旅是个好孩子。总是\n照顾着其他那些家伙……\n我是不是该再夸夸她呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4aa49e9e61b629ca402b3c31e2e4439de646a4929ed911519f9b72c8cf1d3493",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0070f8d6dc73f4e6c6e17e70",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "超常骏骥之前因为怀疑黄金船携带了\r\n芥末气球而追赶她……然而，\r\n原件其实正由我保管着呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "18aaa19b5eacf22a92f3709247c356ebaa89cec9c06bbaec3f38a05dfed739ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac5a843eb225378ecccd4118",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要讨黄金巨匠欢心的话……对了，只\n要帮她的尾巴梳毛她就会很高兴哦。…\n啊，不过她可不会随便让谁碰的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "69aec6069b81c92726c3e7d27d763dfd4d2a4a270bf22bb5d9db66b13f6df480",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:307eba6bc45875314d93a2f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "别看我这样，以前可是个孩子王哦……\n不，现在在别人眼里其实也差不多？\n那……呵呵，倒也不坏。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3c6309b902b54e561e571c94f3799544587cf66fd6b08229d816485428f5eda",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:857ded425c90deea252b448f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既然要办演唱会，那么……\n我也想让大家看看，能永远\n留在记忆里的绝美风景啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7938ad64d1e3fd9543c2f61869249e3d5ffe16c6c831d642a640f22bc88e1faa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0a99aeb7cff0b68c60f74c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "调动观众情绪这种事我可是很有\n信心的。毕竟，随性发挥可是我的\n拿手好戏……呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "41be950db6a3063e2d1314981327c5f2396df54f0eaac334846ef620d757f914",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a0d08b14b34198ac7c0fc2c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "旅行的用具我已经全部备齐了。\n至于为什么……你不觉得这能让我，\n随心所欲地奔向任何地方吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "75dcc84691e4b41c5c43a6b6875de53baa97f0f0ba19f554cb9ff3e8bc51788a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92cc7bf0ac904926e7dc3e0d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "磨损也是经历过长途旅行的证明……\n所谓工具，就是这样\n才会逐渐散发出韵味的吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "85246d62af554163bfebd7968c87ec66b395a5862dbf43cc4366960304f917cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77a10cd803590b3f3ab490d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上学的时候打招呼说早安，经常会\n让人吓一跳呢。大概是觉得，“啊，\n原来今天她居然在啊”这种感觉吧。呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9456ec1dac5bd24738bf3bdef0e12a0a774c9b3e614cd4516fab93c7d21e8bbc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0078d5555aaeb2fbf759ce8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……总觉得啊。大白天的像这样\n待在室内，总觉得\n有一种亏大了的感觉呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b22bb83ba34dce07d830224e9005699caf9119b18848fe726de50dd959f9bd3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0bb23b1c0f57c20e2efdbd1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……说起来还没吃晚饭呢。\n嘛，要是肚子里的家伙说想吃的话\n我就会吃的。嗯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "59f1ffa42bbc341eacb928062c6ac4464178a885a153ab80b6b8a530d7ea9129",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85813f439b6a0af4ae4c3d59",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天气变得相当暖和了。随性地、\n穿件便装就能出远门——\n哈。真是个不错的季节啊……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "17754422d08ca954b82fd5306bcb786dad5df2c9ff8247992ec2da588a8e47a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e4244211faf589240d34d9c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说起来梦旅好像弄到了个大家伙。\n难得有机会，大家一起玩吧……\n蒙眼劈西瓜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9733f610d561d355a132ab0ab2b1b7c058be4e4e4e67a6cf1081995823daecde",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8aec1d8eb48c714bc3b2f170",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "差不多到采蘑菇的好季节了……\n那种像是在山里探险寻宝的感觉\n真让人兴奋啊。你能懂吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "11aaf5db66129d7704d9d68f68288167575e01254150a39af16c4869c29be194",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:024280b8095e14f067e57b1b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你见过漫天雪景吗？\n真想让你体验一下……双脚踏入\n纯白地毯时的那种雀跃感。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e239caec5dd614f1377ce43c9c8f930e2f532c210024cfbef4ecc8817f60019c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3efa36e562c9104eb27900fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘛，开心地做吧。\n旅行的醍醐味，\n可是全都蕴含在过程之中哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f460539de7250a7fba6eb3fa0b9ac1a6cf831dfc6c240943f5a5b994f7d76b20",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a2ddc417c0a86ef58cc601d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好了，今天的训练\n会发生什么呢……让我们试试看吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "937978700aa8cfc1e69bc64d6da774682787ff2fd1ab6cc94a521b1eea0490d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff5c4af0e54e6f0dfff88813",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "慢悠悠地开始吧。……放心，\n我不会偷懒的。毕竟我也一样，\n渴望一场有趣的较量啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "54b173d535d3d475893f2573454357e56d344201b4de5f878af5f0864509b04e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c53189d84caf2f0bf1823c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔——天气真好，空气也清新……\n在外面跑跑也不错……虽然我也可能\n就那样直接去旅行了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e3576ad0bb4143a4476e57e7f59910c4b689c81c8d7878b9c995dda2eecb1e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8cc4aaa9541967ff0993e6b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你正兴奋着呢。\n挺好。对于旅行的伙伴来说，\n那可是必不可少的要素。",
      "source_fingerprint": "26bcdc1801b270f46ed1ee5b1068cf74280f2d40785a4ffeb2f0f629eab423ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b1955d2b4fccfbdee8b3403",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "与你的这场旅行，究竟会抵达何方呢\n……真想在这漫长的途中，\n彻底品味个够啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "148ceb3f89c41384f752f80885ff65db703ae90f937eb2be7a4244e67fc71eab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a11c39ace62622d1734dbe86",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "旅途要有伴……虽然不知道\n是谁说的——但和你在一起，\n我也明白这句话的意思了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "97bb8d3572653fbf84b2803aa55b16a8c548e0f4bbb212da23e909ee06829879",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab55512ad1f1963dde35d50d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好热……不过，真是个不错的地方。\n等太阳下山后，我们去看看\n海岸线到底延伸到哪儿了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b74f56aab0f57788b1a728e9434ad6827c7cf811d18938c7d9b7e1d3122b3b57",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8f0372164922f4e50656711",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么，接下来要去哪里呢……你会来的吧？当然。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b1a5757a725c4eeea1e1f9769ce9070132c0bd0dd363578c5d906380ea3782d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe039529a60b6815e88f2e64",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不会忘记的。那是一段，绝佳的旅程。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d4d0d618859e5d0a22bccac654c83f69fb7993057b7acf893306ffee9c59a67",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fced84b276e4b83c48c64684",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "旅途的终点……或许能看见呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ddc3b3d027b5cb72f8db5050596f90d1f9289a8e6874fb49f727807becbd399b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a03ae68b23deaed241d90f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可以说是，新的旅途已经开启了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "99419fde5f5e0dbcffb1b91bc6ce21b8e59b8007af0171ec9a0b00adcf226861",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21a3876bf303c001eba265e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是黄金旅程。让我们来一场精彩的旅行吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "97ac89d8492d98590b73277067b6a60b94b8c8e6982c4f10adce0b75ea6a879d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81838e1c310df75349ced86f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么——这次又会抵达何方呢？\n要跟上来吗？跟上这趟黄金之旅。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5e85c44596d5a36f1a36986e58725c296f369993fc1f59026fd580936f1e224",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da9607f28c0be606e89f973d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么，下一个目的地是……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c42853f960d447d4578474f66f48bf0f3f45c7c932fd933b6502ec396e3b7af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:498cdba7304f7fbf5413d657",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看看能走到哪儿去吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce7814c8b7b8f2b70978433d3e102c37461592ccb2d9f881c4b9c2297fdb9bee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1135",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2af56e92599561aa54d3e39",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "由我来施以救赎。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf3f00d9ac6ccffb60c8e959aef24cc40813e8d4e84cccc96c66f0eca90a2273",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc3ddebed0de8375f1959eb7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "誓约已牢不可破地缔结。\r\n还请您全力指导我。\r\n一切考验我都必将克服！",
      "source_fingerprint": "293362df7e8c5f9942e2e308a5dc6aa435ecfcdecfd9d120fd580ac235973323",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4705b29c4e739cc48865db5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "874e7497e7be8367a4f334f4c7f1d69916bd93469660e8935829876ff0311191",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4cdf149af1be7d5deedbfda5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f3f071de3a132d55ed31edf557b362afda8ef29b618fd0f52a13920ed7d26bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:198461bb78f90c40f5863c8b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "若是在异界迷失了方向，\r\n我便会叩问驻留于心中的您。\r\n因为您就是我的光芒。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec23b811cb3649184dd0ed3be2ee9887c48e0813a931afd524f0c4f2d3df655a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e64f2a82b2efd90661aa1b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次要不要去巡访您\n充满回忆的故地呢？\n这也将成为属于我们两人的轨迹。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad75db248071f869e922a1cbf5827af2ba46f6f2aa3285f9c5a2038dd67ac593",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f8c5a0bb5b464b7e75351b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "御守、破魔矢……在此就由\n圣女的祈祷赐予更深厚的加护吧！\n训练员，您也一定要来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c29e09cbb84b3098384f02e52322f3c8b48e16fb8348c7e9f1ca6ba0a95e566",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6c3b6320ebb985b87062cb7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "巧克力的隔水加热失败了……不过，\r\n这也是上天降下的试炼！我定会让它\r\n转生为至高巧克力，敬请期待吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "75c0b5295b6cd5131be395d791777c83a451006734dd5bcd69c4a3ba3bc1cf5a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd9eac045dad4fb8d797f63e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "历经仿佛永恒的漫长旅途……终于\r\n找到了。请品尝这裹着精灵恩赐的\r\n果仁糖吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "28538db3f83daa9714873eede8e1e5cd2d1b8cdd9d4690560242f9f9f807b20a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d82478cf34a0acf426ea3d11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了让献给上天的诸多心愿得以传达，\r\n我将全力解放圣女之力……呜呼，\r\n天之长河啊！请倾听我的祈愿吧——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "71a250a8ab8a96317973ffd41b78817ddedea1c936f08287dcc7ba9b98775e22",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:721d685378e62893e2d11d6e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "万圣节……黑暗力量暴涨的一夜……\r\n请千万不要离开我的身旁。\r\n我会用神圣结界来守护您的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bdc787f36a9f281157dafc445aad8271238492e99810300b28aef0baf062fdeb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2b27f83b2ce37d596404f2b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜呼，这正是圣夜！恩宠之日！\r\n我竟然能获赐咖啡同学\r\n亲手培育的咖啡生豆……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac62aea94b953c3b2f32ca704b021f1592055c5e8b290692a2e66877c40fafd7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36dfebbe92e3999dcee3dfbe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "街市披上了繁星的装束，被\n光芒的加护所笼罩。我们要不要\n也一同前去，承领这份恩赐呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "93c1c2d9a1c4e0e3e211251db2c77e420fb393e8aedb3da8489cd85267b82616",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53e467cf02b3894421af5fbb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感谢这份恩宠！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2670ceb355fa3617f40be4983b983fa85f8cdae328f3619620f76378e178b5ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b08ef6c8bc3a8c337965cc8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "直到岁末都必须精进自身。\r\n明年定要抵达全新境界，\r\n推开那扇异界之门！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1773a6453f0ff628a0231ae5656251a78d85dd7523ca02d761e09d16d32ea050",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0cb72e7f32a535059cac4e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我已前往试炼之地巡礼归来。\r\n恭喜您，您这健康平安的一年\r\n已被许诺保障了哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "511605c41a7692d6ce2494de0f0684c57d002d81bbd508c092957d9552066c47",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0654c65b718d1f708cd613d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "您的诞生，实乃天赐的奇迹。\r\n是被派往尘世的指引之光！\r\n呜呼……谨致感恩……并献上祝福。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3495f8ba62734a8d223bf9773a9d12698b454ffd9d9a371459e5e6b4f50a6202",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d73a5760f195441940f1a037",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "景致同学还没来吗……\n约定的乐园……胡萝卜料理美味的\n餐馆，快带我前往吧……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d44f72ce6b511f3a84cfac38c5596e379a0e82940dfabb069007d69177c9e333",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6cb646dc4b6ea8faa8554cd2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜呼，终于……呵呵，\r\n是心底的呼唤传达给您了吧。\r\n来吧，请带我启程……前往庆宴。",
      "source_fingerprint": "67a9410c37552245e32a9ad982e628dab742c67d1e991cdadfa82e4c3429b37f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35eb1be96b93553230523adb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到通知了。\r\n愿它化作照亮黑暗的路标，\r\n为您指引前路……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5e67db6b9a94f5d3ad35463038cf9a2ff6a3c1ffcd83e23c2a2d6937b8f0be9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33bc6b13cad9480e1ce138bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到礼物了。\r\n让我们感谢这崇高的恩赐吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "00e82e1910d92564735bb51ed495dfce300e364467c4d72e0644b3b8ad5f8a73",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d7b8b0fa15e20719dca55ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "您已达成任务了呢。\r\n愿祝福降临于您的钻研之上！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8eb919fd815e3d519b21e7bcd23495daae845b4cb9ca20afa7a06c3aa3b835ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47c6cfb3a34bfbe8aa8e9acf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "已有活动预告了呢。\r\n为了迎接宿命之日，我要蓄积力量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "332ccd079ce6def41281f6824d9ada5ef479dbb0ee0bb2ab8fae715fb9b2621b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1ff040ec863586ea071e1b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动已经开始了。\r\n呵呵，庆典真教人欢欣雀跃呢",
      "source_fingerprint": "d409729467c146a18425f0eac67803735fd3f721c60fb572cf4be18c4e0be03b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e04b5c5abccb8274b933944f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "当下当经受试炼……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8239cfada974a71e05fd8300104b65db6dff528ca6f20ed282a0fcbb4f44f4ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49e218df814caa5cec8077a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名鉴等级提升了。\r\n当作为智慧之书，广为流布。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3c9dfcf2e58af86643db36797f12aee3e25f72815a5f08eaef669fc388cf61b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56655bb3135b87405b675f78",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "将寄宿于衣裳的神圣群星之加护，\r\n倾注于这世间吧。即便天光隐曜的\r\n晦暗之日，亦可高枕无忧……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "406ad45badceb4cb1e657c9ae0aa86808c6f371aa5c40fbfeb43b7fee2134c7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30b583f677f4f32059bc625d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请看，这缎带上的装饰。\r\n明丽的金芒乃是纯洁的光辉……\r\n在商店里我一眼便相中了呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e69858a44a6e232cd78cb3a69ae38a8f02e699a20d812be5a27600da4011412",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1007dfda0348827a2e398b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "休息日我都会手洗衣物。\r\n在专注洗净污渍的过程中，\r\n心中的杂念沉渣也能一并涤除。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a70d5c75a75e89a53817e771a7fa5508f9928ffbdf43649061633a2df710114c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2a2282c364e07ae00992f7a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "均衡并未打破……",
      "source_fingerprint": "57ef408d5854306431c451741bfc638c01becabae64a42dc0a4ae453d9cb9572",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9989ec5b9286f9ae32ae1649",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "衷心献上祝福！",
      "source_fingerprint": "71942f2c1de2b9222db11abc4cf438750d19b9d7d412ddcb99e6983022ba471b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91d9c253ac338d0e61d63995",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "当下当经受试炼……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8239cfada974a71e05fd8300104b65db6dff528ca6f20ed282a0fcbb4f44f4ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f01ff66505cd2e8b3a2c2eb9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "均衡并未打破……",
      "source_fingerprint": "57ef408d5854306431c451741bfc638c01becabae64a42dc0a4ae453d9cb9572",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef5a01bc4a5481a8bc26c14d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "迈向全新境界！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8181202ae17db822d34bd9490cbb2a98be60c9f2bc4f7b2a2b8ded4a775e0b19",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f927ec85ca33797ece43c6d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "朝着崭新的世界。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5acddbc10f4831edfaee510df0a3d75935d13135bf8c399856f69f507c7f5db3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14037679bec5ebe38fe05107",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3de7ff97db4c0216ecac1cfe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "投身于锻炼之中吧。\r\n为了通往真正的圣女之路。",
      "source_fingerprint": "55637fc9251cecb9cd44bc2878f891c8efa55edbb77e323801b89647569b5c8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:966434534004b7252e47ba2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这莫非是……新的教义……！\r\n真是耐人寻味！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b30cea8a063e69b6c8c19f5a602015be620e2e9632c9418b48b962f69303e849",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:339f9b3996d25197cc6426a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是要去迎战相争竞逐的宿命呢。\r\n让我们一同前往吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2db15c5597df930a3bb3433f495d5d4b8e136b366ea76dbc52570d093f73fdc2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d1a3e5f2ecd5d2a59b5934c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘 Pretty Derby",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fb57ac68b66f1546f9801f5aaf6a725ec4388807ec83792fcbb5cebd8d3fbba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:109df037e6b4a47b664e598e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "蒙受恩宠了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "baa6f46525e99056bca2662558d88467bcd6a30707b33d79cef52e3e58a1ac55",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "120000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d96dbb2918429e5bfe9df2f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请指引我吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "43ceed5818ee3950016418438bbeda3cd0753cf70587f36ffd642f4c265c4a42",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "1268"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6b84619c562effbf857d35c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赐予我神圣之力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d96858a81f757d475838466f49e5d9e0930787f342712e9d92bfacd1e936d3b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1136",
        "1269"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
